 to OS timezone with `TimeZone.getDefault();`, But tests in `TimeAxisTest` expects the timezone to be UTC. These tests can fail when tested locally in other regions.\r\n\r\nWe can reproduce this error with \r\n```\r\nmvn test -Dtest=TimeAxisTest -Duser.timezone=CST\r\n```\r\nwhich will failed the assertions.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUse the `setTimeZone()` provided by `RrdGraphDef` before testing.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:41:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-11-14T08:07:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-14T08:07:02Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-14T08:07:02Z", "merge_commit_sha": "d7b991d6cec25b21e973406739f392843496da03", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "swj20010308:fix-flaky-TimeAxisTest", "ref": "fix-flaky-TimeAxisTest", "repo": {"id": 1090708812, "node_id": "R_kgDOQQLlTA", "name": "rrd4j", "full_name": "swj20010308/rrd4j", "owner": {"login": "swj20010308", "id": 103343744, "node_id": "U_kgDOBijmgA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103343744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308", "html_url": "https://github.com/swj20010308", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/swj20010308/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true,